		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>ci-dessous la Config postgres:</p><p><strong>lc_messages = &#039;en_US.UTF-8&#039;&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;# locale for system error message<br />&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; # strings<br />lc_monetary = &#039;fr_FR.UTF-8&#039;&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;# locale for monetary formatting<br />lc_numeric = &#039;fr_FR.UTF-8&#039;&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; # locale for number formatting<br />lc_time = &#039;fr_FR.UTF-8&#039;&#160; <br /></strong></p>]]></content>
